Description:

MIME parsing now stops descending into a nested message/rfc822 part once
:imapdconf:`boundary_limit` is reached, treating deeper parts as opaque.
Previously that limit was enforced only through the boundary stack, onto which
the message/rfc822 path pushes nothing, so a deep chain of nested messages
recursed without bound.


