Tracked as GitHub security advisory GHSA-mq8g-hj53-jr9j.


CVE description:

Deeply nested message/rfc822 parts crash the MIME parser

A message that was a deep chain of nested message/rfc822 parts recursed
without bound and overflowed the stack.  Delivered over LMTP, this crashed the
delivery daemon, and required no authentication.


